claude-tools-marketplace (Bioqore): secret guard idea
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: claude-tools-marketplace@08fff7e
  plugins/bioqore-team/hooks/check-secrets.py, by Kai Suematsu for Bioqore.

Idea credit; re-implemented, no code copied. The repository carries no license
file, so nothing from it is reproduced here. The idea (scan only the lines a
commit or push adds, skip obvious placeholders, report the file and the kind of
secret) is re-implemented as scripts/check_secrets.py, with Kalos patterns, a
fail-closed CLI and diff-header parsing that keeps paths intact.
